$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2stkup6  LOC_AFTER=?

* Six updates of a stack assignment at three distinct indices collapse to three: the term one iteration of a three-stack scan loop produces, reduced to the loop invariant's form.  ~ tm2stkupc , ~ tm2stkup3 and ~ tm2stkup2 .

